    IsSelfDualC S ΛS → IsSelfDualC T ΛT → ∀ f₀ : WO S T → ℂ,
    IsVacO ψ θ S T sS sT (ΛS : Set (Fin S.rank → D.host.E)) (ΛT : Set (Fin T.rank → D.host.E)) f₀ →
